,\"spm\":\"1035.2249.3001.6650.16\"}","type":"download"},{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Fblog.csdn.net\u002Fqq_43173805\u002Farticle\u002Fdetails\u002F118615123","title":"从POI兴趣点获取到ArcGIS中热力图制作","desc":"1.\nPOI获取及坐标点转换\nPOI获取我们要借助下面这个网站↓↓↓\n规划云http:\u002F\u002Fguihuayun.com\u002Fpoi\u002F\n搜索POI兴趣点并复制兴趣点，\n图\n新建txt文本文档，粘贴兴趣点\n图片\n查看后得知，lng为横坐标，lat为纵坐标\n文件，另存为csv格式文件，编码为utf—8\n\n打开QGIS，因为我们pol点是从百度地图上获取的，为BD09坐标系，与WGS84有一定偏移【GCJ02：火星坐标系，是由中国国家测绘局制订的地理信息系统的坐标系统。由WGS84坐标系经加密后的坐标系。\nBD09：为.","nickname":"GIS前沿","createTime":"2021-07-09 21:40:40","dataReportQuery":"spm=1035.2249.3001.6650.17&utm_medium=distribute.pc_relevant_bbs_down_v2.none-task-blog-relrec_t_fallback_v1-17-118615123-bbs-396870384.264^v3^pc_relevant_bbs_down_v2_default&depth_1-utm_source=distribute.pc_relevant_bbs_down_v2.none-task-blog-relrec_t_fallback_v1-17-118615123-bbs-396870384.264^v3^pc_relevant_bbs_down_v2_default","dataReportClick":"{\"mod\":\"popu_645\",\"index\":\"17\",\"dest\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fblog.csdn.net\u002Fqq_43173805\u002Farticle\u002Fdetails\u002F118615123\",\"strategy\":\"relrec_t_fallback_v1\",\"extra\":\"{\\\"utm_medium\\\":\\\"distribute.pc_relevant_bbs_down_v2.none-task-blog-relrec_t_fallback_v1-17-118615123-bbs-396870384.264^v3^pc_relevant_bbs_down_v2_default\\\",\\\"dist_request_id\\\":\\\"silkroad_1792593209946\\\"}\",\"spm\":\"1035.2249.3001.6650.17\"}","dataReportView":"{\"mod\":\"popu_645\",\"index\":\"17\",\"dest\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fblog.csdn.net\u002Fqq_43173805\u002Farticle\u002Fdetails\u002F118615123\",\"strategy\":\"relrec_t_fallback_v1\",\"extra\":\"{\\\"utm_medium\\\":\\\"distribute.pc_relevant_bbs_down_v2.none-task-blog-relrec_t_fallback_v1-17-118615123-bbs-396870384.264^v3^pc_relevant_bbs_down_v2_default\\\",\\\"dist_request_id\\\":\\\"silkroad_1792593209946\\\"}\",\"spm\":\"1035.2249.3001.6650.17\"}","type":"blog"},{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Fblog.csdn.net\u002Fjkh920184196\u002Farticle\u002Fdetails\u002F148077298","title":"特性阻抗 – SI\u002FPI 世界碰撞的地方","desc":"除了谐振零点和峰值外，在一定频率下，传输线的阻抗看起来像远端开路时的电容器的阻抗，也看起来像远端短路时电感的阻抗。如果随后的制造变化将测得的阻抗推到 -10% 容差的低端（例如 44 欧姆）的测量区域内，那么如果在初始下降时测量，则真正的特性阻抗将在 42 欧姆时降低 5%，并且超出规格。这意味着，当我们测量红色或蓝色图的峰和相邻谷之间的中间阻抗时，它是该频率下传输线的特性阻抗。图 7 远端开路时（红色常亮）与远端短路时（蓝色常亮）的电感和电容抗阻抗与频率的关系（上图）和传输线的阻抗与频率（下图）的对比。","nickname":"David WangYang","createTime":"2025-05-20 00:09:18","dataReportQuery":"spm=1035.2249.3001.6650.18&utm_medium=distribute.pc_relevant_bbs_down_v2.none-task-blog-relrec_t_fallback_v1-18-148077298-bbs-396870384.264^v3^pc_relevant_bbs_down_v2_default&depth_1-utm_source=distribute.pc_relevant_bbs_down_v2.none-task-blog-relrec_t_fallback_v1-18-148077298-bbs-396870384.264^v3^pc_relevant_bbs_down_v2_default","dataReportClick":"{\"mod\":\"popu_645\",\"index\":\"18\",\"dest\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fblog.csdn.net\u002Fjkh920184196\u002Farticle\u002Fdetails\u002F148077298\",\"strategy\":\"relrec_t_fallback_v1\",\"extra\":\"{\\\"utm_medium\\\":\\\"distribute.pc_relevant_bbs_down_v2.none-task-blog-relrec_t_fallback_v1-18-148077298-bbs-396870384.264^v3^pc_relevant_bbs_down_v2_default\\\",\\\"dist_request_id\\\":\\\"silkroad_1792593209946\\\"}\",\"spm\":\"1035.2249.3001.6650.18\"}","dataReportView":"{\"mod\":\"popu_645\",\"index\":\"18\",\"dest\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fblog.csdn.net\u002Fjkh920184196\u002Farticle\u002Fdetails\u002F148077298\",\"strategy\":\"relrec_t_fallback_v1\",\"extra\":\"{\\\"utm_medium\\\":\\\"distribute.pc_relevant_bbs_down_v2.none-task-blog-relrec_t_fallback_v1-18-148077298-bbs-396870384.264^v3^pc_relevant_bbs_down_v2_default\\\",\\\"dist_request_id\\\":\\\"silkroad_1792593209946\\\"}\",\"spm\":\"1035.2249.3001.6650.18\"}","type":"blog"},{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Fblog.csdn.net\u002Fweixin_42573757\u002Farticle\u002Fdetails\u002F116384944","title":"oracle 11.2.0.3.0 client\u003Cem\u003E下载\u003C\u002Fem\u003E,oracle64位客户端 Instant Client","desc":"oracle64位 客户端安装程序，Instant Client v11.2.0.3.0(64-bit)可以用，bo客户端需要配这个的，所以装了一个，64位操作系统中、不安装Oracle-32bit客户端，方便使用PLSQL Developer(不支持64bit位Oracle客户端)安装教程安装配置instantclient\u003C